Here is a vt200 termcap entry, unsupported by Digital Equipment
Corporation. The VT200 series terminals have to be changed in the
setup menu default mode to wrap around on, and 7 bits any parity 
mode.  This will run on 4.2bsd Un*x.  Good luck!

-------------------------------

